{"seq":2,"slug":"texturing-sampling","title":"纹理与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/texturing-sampling","wordCount":1453,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"纹理与采样\">纹理与采样</h1><p>如果每一处表面细节都要用几何来表达，再强的显卡也撑不住。所以现代渲染把绝大部分细节交给纹理——一张张存在显存里的图像，在着色时按需取样贴到表面上。但「取样」这个词骗了很多人：它远不是「读出某个像素」那么简单。一个屏幕像素可能对应纹理上的一小片区域，也可能跨越上百个纹素；如何在不同距离、不同角度下都取得平滑无锯齿又不糊的结果，是一门关于过滤、Mipmap 和压缩的精细学问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-uv-到颜色\">核心概念：从 UV 到颜色</h2><p>纹理采样的链条始于纹理坐标（UV），终于一个经过过滤的颜色值。中间每一步都可能成为画质或性能的瓶颈：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;顶点 UV 坐标&lt;br/&gt;建模时展开&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;光栅化插值&lt;br/&gt;得到每片元 UV&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;计算 UV 导数&lt;br/&gt;ddx/ddy 估算覆盖面积&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;选择 Mipmap 层级&lt;br/&gt;面积越大层级越粗&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;纹理过滤&lt;br/&gt;双线性/三线性/各向异性&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;寻址模式&lt;br/&gt;repeat/clamp/mirror&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;最终采样颜色&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"顶点 UV 坐标&lt;br/&gt;建模时展开\"] --&gt; B[\"光栅化插值&lt;br/&gt;得到每片元 UV\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"计算 UV 导数&lt;br/&gt;ddx/ddy 估算覆盖面积\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"选择 Mipmap 层级&lt;br/&gt;面积越大层级越粗\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"纹理过滤&lt;br/&gt;双线性/三线性/各向异性\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"寻址模式&lt;br/&gt;repeat/clamp/mirror\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"最终采样颜色\"]</pre><p>UV 坐标在建模阶段展开（UV unwrap），随顶点传入并被光栅化插值，这一步依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/gpu-pipeline\">GPU 渲染管线</a> 的透视正确插值。GPU 用相邻片元的 UV 差分（<code>ddx</code>/<code>ddy</code>）估算这个像素覆盖了纹理上多大一片区域，据此自动选择合适的 Mipmap 层级——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/shader-languages\">着色器语言 HLSL/GLSL</a> 里讲过的导数函数的核心用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过滤-对抗锯齿与模糊\">过滤：对抗锯齿与模糊</h2><p>直接取最近纹素（最近邻过滤）会在放大时产生马赛克、缩小时产生闪烁。过滤就是用周围多个纹素加权混合来平滑这些瑕疵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤方式</th>\n<th>采样数</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最近邻</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>最便宜，像素风可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双线性</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>放大时的块状</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三线性</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Mipmap 层级间的突变</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各向异性</td>\n<td>最多 16x</td>\n<td>掠射角下的模糊</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双线性在 UV 周围取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个纹素按距离加权；三线性再在两个相邻 Mipmap 层级间插值，消除层级切换时地面上那条可见的「分界线」。各向异性过滤专治掠射角问题：当你以很斜的角度看地面，一个像素覆盖的纹理区域是被严重拉长的长条形，普通过滤只会取个正方形区域导致发糊，各向异性过滤沿拉长方向多次采样，让远处地面纹理依然清晰。它是画质设置里 2x/4x/8x/16x 那个选项的本体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mipmap-为缩小而生的金字塔\">Mipmap：为缩小而生的金字塔</h2><p>Mipmap 是同一张纹理的一系列逐级减半的预缩小版本，组成一座分辨率金字塔。当物体远离相机、纹理在屏幕上被缩小时，直接采样原始高分辨率纹理会因为采样点稀疏而产生严重闪烁（aliasing）。Mipmap 让 GPU 改去采样一张已经预先缩小、平滑过的版本，从根本上避免了欠采样。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>level</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>texSize</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{level} = \\log_2\\left(\\max\\left(\\left\\|\\frac{\\partial uv}{\\partial x}\\right\\|, \\left\\|\\frac{\\partial uv}{\\partial y}\\right\\|\\right) \\cdot \\text{texSize}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">level</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">texSize</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Mipmap 额外占用约 1/3 的显存（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + 1/4 + 1/16 + \\dots \\approx 4/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/3</span></span></span></span></span>），但换来的是画质与性能双赢——缩小的纹理访问更小的 mip 层，缓存命中率更高。在片元着色器里，绝大多数情况应让 GPU 自动选层级（<code>Sample</code>）；只有在动态分支内采样等导数失效的场景，才需手动指定层级（<code>SampleLevel</code>）。这一点与 <a href=\"../foundations/gpu-pipeline\">GPU 渲染管线</a> 的 SIMT 导数机制紧密相关。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hlsl\" data-code=\"Texture2D    albedoTex : register(t0);&#10;SamplerState samp      : register(s0);&#10;&#10;float4 PSMain(VSOut i) : SV_Target {&#10;    float3 base = albedoTex.Sample(samp, i.uv).rgb;          // 自动选 mip&#10;    // 在 if 分支内必须手动指定层级，否则导数未定义：&#10;    // float3 base = albedoTex.SampleLevel(samp, i.uv, 2.0).rgb;&#10;    return float4(base, 1.0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Texture2D    albedoTex : register(t0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SamplerState samp      : register(s0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float4 PSMain(VSOut i) : SV_Target {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float3 base = albedoTex.Sample(samp, i.uv).rgb;          // 自动选 mip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在 if 分支内必须手动指定层级，否则导数未定义：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // float3 base = albedoTex.SampleLevel(samp, i.uv, 2.0).rgb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return float4(base, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"寻址模式与纹理类型\">寻址模式与纹理类型</h2><p>当 UV 超出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 范围，寻址模式决定如何取样：repeat（平铺，做地砖墙纸）、clamp（钳到边缘，避免边缘渗色）、mirror（镜像平铺）、border（取固定边界色）。选错寻址模式是接缝瑕疵的常见来源——例如本该 clamp 的贴图用了 repeat，边缘就会出现对侧像素渗入。</p>\n<p>纹理也不止 2D。常见类型包括：1D（查找表/渐变）、2D（最常用）、3D（体积数据、噪声查找）、立方体贴图（环境反射、天空盒，配合 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型与 BRDF</a> 的 IBL）、纹理数组（同尺寸图层批量管理）。法线贴图、粗糙度图、金属度图等都是把材质参数编码进纹理通道，它们如何组织成一套材质，见 <a href=\"pbr-materials\">PBR 材质</a>。程序化生成的噪声也常被烘焙成纹理或在采样时实时计算，见 <a href=\"../advanced-effects/procedural-noise\">程序化纹理与噪声</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纹理压缩与带宽\">纹理压缩与带宽</h2><p>纹理是显存与带宽的最大消费者之一，因此几乎不会以原始 RGBA 存储。GPU 支持硬件解压的块压缩格式：桌面端的 BC 系列（BC1/DXT1 ~4:1、BC5 双通道法线、BC7 高质量、BC6H 用于 HDR），移动端的 ASTC（可变块大小、质量灵活）与老旧的 ETC2。这些格式在采样时由硬件实时解压，几乎不增加运行时开销，却把显存占用和带宽压力降到原来的几分之一。</p>\n<p>带宽往往是片元着色器的真正瓶颈：一个屏幕填满的着色器若采样多张未压缩纹理，很容易卡在内存而非算力上。如何度量与缓解纹理带宽瓶颈，是 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/shader-optimization\">着色器性能优化</a> 的重要议题；不同平台支持的压缩格式差异，则关系到 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/cross-platform-shaders\">跨平台与着色器编译</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纹理采样不是简单读像素：UV 经插值后，GPU 用导数估算覆盖区域、选 Mipmap 层级、再过滤。</li>\n<li>双线性/三线性/各向异性过滤逐级解决放大块状、层级突变、掠射角模糊问题。</li>\n<li>Mipmap 用约 1/3 额外显存换取抗闪烁与更好的缓存命中；动态分支内须手动指定层级。</li>\n<li>寻址模式决定越界采样行为；纹理有 2D/3D/立方体/数组等多种类型，承载各类材质参数。</li>\n<li>块压缩格式（BC/ASTC/ETC2）由硬件实时解压，是控制显存与带宽的关键，见 <a href=\"../optimization-tools/shader-optimization\">着色器性能优化</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"纹理与采样","id":"纹理与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从 UV 到颜色","id":"核心概念-从-uv-到颜色"},{"level":2,"text":"过滤：对抗锯齿与模糊","id":"过滤-对抗锯齿与模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"Mipmap：为缩小而生的金字塔","id":"mipmap-为缩小而生的金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"寻址模式与纹理类型","id":"寻址模式与纹理类型"},{"level":2,"text":"纹理压缩与带宽","id":"纹理压缩与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"光照模型与 BRDF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/lighting-models"},"next":{"title":"PBR 材质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/shader-programming/shading-techniques/pbr-materials"}}